Z||000009||FieroHarry||07-14-2001||10:13 PM||||These are produced for "LUND" and are "Eclipse" model truck scoops that are applied using two sided tape ( you can find them in catalogs at most part stores). They came with fake plastic vent screens, I used old engine vents screens from my Fiero parts car to have the standard Honey comb finish...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR><B>Harry Waggoner</B><BR>1985 GT 266K+ <I>FOCOSEVA,FOCOA</I><BR><B>"If you want to blend in, take the bus!"</B><p>[This message has been edited by FieroHarry (edited 07-14-2001).]||||reg||1
